=
\frac{L_{\mathrm{refi}}}{V_{\mathrm{refi}}}
=
\frac{600{,}000}{800{,}000}
=
0.75
=
75\%.$ Todd does not use the term $\mathrm{LTV}$ in the interview. We use it only as a clean way to read the financing arithmetic.

